    {
      "title": "Mechanism",
      "body": "nanosheet_morphology → diffusion"
    },
    {
      "title": "Design Rule",
      "body": "[positive] orient grain boundaries parallel to the bulk phase → molecular sieving action is enhanced"
    },
    {
