      "body": "[positive] enlarge nanopore diameter or shorten nanoporous diffusion pathlength by designing hierarchical nanoporous materials → mass transport efficiency is enhanced"
    },
    {
      "title": "Comparison",
      "body": "membrane with grain boundary extending to the membrane surface vs membrane with grain boundary parallel to the bulk phase: winner=subject_a on CO2_permeability_vs_selectivity_tradeoff"
    },
